      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The proposed discovery lineage is unsupported: Lehmer's recurrence argument targets repeated cancellation and low extrema, whereas the later source describes a close pair found in a large zero computation and does not attribute that discovery to the cancellation heuristic. The later close-pair recomputation and Lehmer-inequality certificate form a valid two-parent pipeline, but the cited early parent cannot be joined to it as claimed.",
